  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who identify as or are politically aligned with 'liberal women in favor of Islam,' as explicitly targeted by the top text. The meme is designed to provoke outrage and hostility toward this specific demographic by blaming them for enabling the sale of child brides into sexual slavery, using the image of a distressed child to amplify its message. This audience is framed as morally culpable for a human rights violation, even though the image does not provide evidence of their involvement or the girl's religious or cultural context. The meme leverages anti-Islam political rhetoric and Islamophobic stereotypes to delegitimize and demonize this group, aiming to incite fear and prejudice against Muslims, thereby targeting those who may support or sympathize with this community.",
